      "created_at": "2011-10-15T15:01:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Traffic Pileup does, as it entirely prohibits the drawing of Hero cards.  The blanket statement of “Players <span class=\"bbcode-b\">cannot</span> draw Hero cards” is absolute.</p>",
